{"unit_id":"zzh-newlearner__dsh-postmortem#feature-1","repo":"zzh-newlearner/dsh-postmortem","commit":"0c7e828dfcbc3207e14cfcd1393a054de2515971","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Postmortem 的功能「失败轮次诊断」：分析选定 turn 的 session 事件，识别工具报错、缺失结果、重复调用和异常结束，并给出建议。运行 `/postmortem` 查看复盘。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/diagnose.ts:35-131","src/index.ts:215-223"]}
